{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Zebra 是一款專為 iPhone 和 iPad 設計的原生 Markdown 筆記應用，無需註冊帳號即可使用。它主打離線寫作與本地存儲，適合追求隱私保護及需要隨時隨地記錄靈感的使用者。目前該 App 正進行<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>活動，原本售價為 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-59.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能編輯與圖文混排</h2>\n<p>Zebra 提供流暢的編輯體驗，Markdown 標記會隨光標移動自動顯示或隱藏。用戶可直接在頁面中創建 Mermaid 流程圖、思維導圖及 LaTeX 數學公式，並支援代碼高亮與表格調整。透過資料夾、嵌套標籤及 [[wiki links 功能，能輕鬆組織龐大的筆記庫，實現知識的有效連接與搜尋。此外，App 內建 22 種主題，讓用戶根據心情調整視覺風格，兼顧美觀與實用性。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-51-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-52-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-53-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-54-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-55-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-56-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Zebra: Markdown Notes</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/zebra-markdown-notes/id6823228567?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:04:59.017514+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":389,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T01:41:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:59:08.829263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:58:39.785875+00:00","content_hash":"acccf9a3f8576d1f11b24e4195831a5f06b122935bdef276b34cc90bfdbae443","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}